">\r\n      <a href=\"https://mpptjournal.com/track?id={{PAPER_ID}}\" class=\"btn\" target=\"_blank\">View Live Tracking Status &rarr;</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#5c5344;margin-top:20px;\">\r\n      <em>No action is required from you at this time. Thank you for your cooperation during technical screening.</em>\r\n    </p>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"footer\">\r\n    <strong>Editorial Review Desk · Journal of Modern Pharmacy Praxis &amp; Therapeutics</strong><br>\r\n    MIDC Sambhaajinagar, Chinchwad, Pune, Maharashtra 411019, India<br>\r\n    Review Desk: <a href=\"mailto:review@mpptjournal.com\" style=\"color:#8c3b3b;\">review@mpptjournal.com</a> · Website: <a href=\"https://mpptjournal.com\" style=\"color:#8c3b3b;\">mpptjournal.com</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n",
